{
 "brief": "Israel has proposed transferring the remains of Jews buried in historical cemeteries in Lebanon to Israel in exchange for the release of Lebanese prisoners, according to Lebanese and Israeli media reports cited by Shehab Wire. The offer was presented during ongoing negotiations between Israeli and Lebanese officials.\n\nDetails of the prisoner exchange remain unclear from available reports. The proposal would involve moving remains from what are described as historically significant burial sites within Lebanese territory. The exact number of Lebanese detainees whose release Israel is seeking in the exchange has not been disclosed in the accounts of the negotiations.",
